       81             FGCOLOR 4
       82        RECT-7 AT ROW 1.48 COL 1
       83       WITH 1 DOWN NO-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER OVERLAY
       84            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D
       85            AT COL 1 ROW 1 SCROLLABLE
